{
  "_comment": [
    "The canonical places in Mistria, seeded from the 61 distinct tokens that",
    "Items.location actually contains.",
    "",
    "Every record here has `anchor: null` and carries `anchor` in data_gaps. That is",
    "deliberate. Anchors are coordinates in a hand-drawn map's viewBox, and the maps",
    "have not been drawn yet — a placeholder coordinate would look exactly like a",
    "real one and would put pins in the wrong place with total confidence.",
    "Anchors land at milestone D4, alongside the SVGs.",
    "",
    "Mine biomes are locations AND have floor ranges. The floor range lives on the",
    "availability window's `depth`, not here, because the same fish can be in a river",
    "and on mine floors 21-39."
  ],
